{#
/**
 * @file
 * An announcement, as a notice-board card.
 *
 * Rendered by the mcc_announcements view for the front page band. The picture
 * and the text both come through the teaser view display — the media "medium"
 * view mode, which is the uncropped responsive style, and the body's own text
 * format — so neither the image style nor the format is a template decision.
 * The link is read in _mcc_theme_announcement_context(); the component makes
 * the title the anchor only when there is one.
 *
 * Emptiness is tested on the rendered string but the render array is what is
 * passed on — the same reason as node--bio--teaser.html.twig.
 */
#}
{% set image = content.field_featured_image|render|trim is not empty ? content.field_featured_image : null %}
{% set text = content.body|render|trim is not empty ? content.body : null %}

{% include 'mcc_theme:mcc-announcement-card' with {
  attributes: attributes,
  title: node.label,
  url: mcc_announcement.url,
  link_label: mcc_announcement.link_label,
  image: image,
  text: text,
} only %}
